B.RH=new A.a3("Search and open","Type English or Mongolian in the large search box. Tap a result to read its English definition and Book example. Tap a linked word or Connected terms to explore related meanings; All connected terms expands the list. Choose the intended meaning when offered alternatives. \xd7 clears the search; Back returns to the previous page.")
B.RB=new A.a3("Speak and listen",u.a)
B.RV=new A.a3("Favorites and saved translations","Tap the star on an entry to add or remove a Favorite. Open \u2630 \u2192 Favorites to retrieve it. Open Notes to write personal notes, then Save notes; Save Translation stores a personally checked translation after \u201cI checked it \u2014 save\u201d; Save new version keeps an updated copy. The bookmarks button opens Saved Translations; Remove deletes only that saved translation after confirmation. These records stay on this device; do not uninstall or clear app data to keep them.")
B.RI=new A.a3("Correct, Remember and Forget","After MN voice search, tap Correct voice result, choose the intended entry and tap Remember. A matching correction can be opened or searched; Forget removes that correction. Confirm \u201cDid you mean\u2026\u201d suggestions before searching. Corrections help this app on this phone; they do not retrain the speech engine or verify a translation.")
B.Sb=new A.a3("Offline and Online","The dictionary, local bilingual searches, Favorites, notes and saved translations work offline. Online translation is optional and off by default. Tap Online after entering Mongolian text; allow it when prompted, or enable it in \u2630 \u2192 Privacy & online translation; it sends Mongolian search text to MyMemory. It is a fallback, so known local terms still search offline. A provider may return no useful match, reject a request or time out. Do not send confidential information. Turn it off in the same menu.")
B.RK=new A.a3("Supporting Resources and internet","Use Supporting Resources for the reference list. App help opens instructions and technical help. Tap a named source button at the end of a definition to open its supporting webpage. Sources and online translation need internet. Android normally prefers working Wi-Fi; otherwise it may use mobile data according to your settings. Mobile data charges may apply. For Wi-Fi only, turn mobile data off in phone settings. A source can support a translation or legal context without certifying every word. Pending review is not professor verification.")
B.RS=new A.a3("Navigation and help","\u2630 opens chapters, Favorites, this guide and privacy settings. The book button opens About / Introduction. START opens these English and Mongolian instructions before the introduction; returning readers can use SKIP THIS. Browse all chapters opens the chapter list; Return to search returns to searching. Close dismisses a panel; Cancel leaves the action unconfirmed. Retry repeats an unavailable operation. Save confirmations and error messages tell you whether an action succeeded.")
B.S9=new A.a3("Error Reporting Box","Open a vocabulary entry and tap Report a Problem / \u0410\u043b\u0434\u0430\u0430 \u043c\u044d\u0434\u044d\u044d\u043b\u044d\u0445 at the top. For a general technical problem, use the same button on the search screen. Report an incorrect definition, Mongolian translation, pronunciation, entry information or app behavior. Select English or \u041c\u043e\u043d\u0433\u043e\u043b and an error category, describe the problem (at least 10 characters), and optionally suggest a correction. Tap Send report / \u041c\u044d\u0434\u044d\u044d\u043b\u044d\u043b \u0438\u043b\u0433\u044d\u044d\u0445 once and wait. The success message confirms that a report was accepted into the author\u2019s private GitHub inbox for review. A failed submission keeps your text on this page so you can retry. Closing the page loses unsent text. Internet is required; students do not need GitHub accounts. Reports do not automatically change the dictionary. Do not include personal or confidential information.")
